Package: CellChatCustomPlots
Title: Custom Heatmaps and Bubble Plots for CellChat Objects
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lina", "Kroehling", , "lkroeh@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Makes custom heatmaps and bubble plots for 1) looking at only specific signaling pathways or cell types, and 2) pooling individual cellchat objects.  This is useful is cellchat was run on each patient separately, and you want to look at the pooled pathway signaling across patients, or to create a bubble plot of specific LR interactions, and incorporate how many patients the interaction was identified in and the average signaling strength.
URL: https://lkroeh.github.io/CellChatCustomPlots
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
